{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "95d1e985-d694-4f8f-874e-8d710d0cdaf0",
		"name": "AIClass API v2.0 (With Auth)",
		"description": "Complete collection of endpoints for AIClass Student Performance Management System v2.0 with JWT Authentication.\n\n## Authentication Setup\n\n### Step 1: Get JWT Token from Supabase\n\nYou need to authenticate with Supabase to get a JWT token. You have two options:\n\n#### Option A: Using Supabase Dashboard (SQL Editor)\n```sql\n-- Create a test teacher user\nINSERT INTO auth.users (id, email, encrypted_password, email_confirmed_at, raw_user_meta_data)\nVALUES (\n  gen_random_uuid(),\n  'teacher@university.edu',\n  crypt('password123', gen_salt('bf')),\n  now(),\n  '{\n    \"full_name\": \"Test Teacher\",\n    \"role\": \"TEACHER\"\n  }'::jsonb\n);\n\n-- Create a test student user\nINSERT INTO auth.users (id, email, encrypted_password, email_confirmed_at, raw_user_meta_data)\nVALUES (\n  gen_random_uuid(),\n  'student@test.com',\n  crypt('password123', gen_salt('bf')),\n  now(),\n  '{\n    \"full_name\": \"Test Student\",\n    \"role\": \"STUDENT\"\n  }'::jsonb\n);\n```\n\n#### Option B: Using Supabase Auth API (Recommended)\n\n**Signup Request:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST 'https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co/auth/v1/signup' \\\n  -H 'apikey: YOUR_ANON_KEY' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"email\": \"teacher@university.edu\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"full_name\": \"Test Teacher\",\n      \"role\": \"TEACHER\"\n    }\n  }'\n```\n\n**Login Request:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST 'https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password' \\\n  -H 'apikey: YOUR_ANON_KEY' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"email\": \"teacher@university.edu\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n  }'\n```\n\n### Step 2: Copy the JWT Token\n\nFrom the login response, copy the `access_token` value.\n\n### Step 3: Set Token in Postman\n\n1. Go to this collection's **Authorization** tab\n2. Select **Bearer Token** type\n3. Paste your JWT token\n4. OR set it as a collection variable: `jwt_token`\n\n### Step 4: Test Authentication\n\nTry the \"Get All Users\" request. If you get a 200 response, authentication is working!\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nMake sure to set these in your Postman environment:\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080\n- `jwt_token`: Your JWT token from Supabase\n- `supabase_url`: https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co\n- `supabase_anon_key`: Your Supabase anon key",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Signup (Supabase)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "apikey",
								"value": "{{supabase_anon_key}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
					"body": {
						"mode": "raw",
						"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"teacher@university.edu\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"full_name\": \"Test Teacher\",\n    \"role\": \"teacher\"\n  }\n}"
					},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/signup",
							"host": [
								"{{supabase_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"v1",
								"signup"
							]
						},
						"description": "Create a new user in Supabase Auth. The JWT token will be returned in the response."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Extract and save the JWT token automatically",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"        // Save JWT token",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', jsonData.access_token);",
									"        ",
									"        // Save Auth User ID",
									"        const authUserId = jsonData.user.id;",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_user_id', authUserId);",
									"        ",
									"        console.log('✅ JWT token saved');",
									"        console.log('✅ Auth User ID:', authUserId);",
									"        ",
									"        // Fetch database user ID",
									"        pm.sendRequest({",
									"            url: pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') + '/api/users/auth/' + authUserId,",
									"            method: 'GET',",
									"            header: {",
									"                'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + jsonData.access_token,",
									"                'Content-Type': 'application/json'",
									"            }",
									"        }, function (err, response) {",
									"            if (err) {",
									"                console.error('❌ Failed to fetch user profile:', err);",
									"            } else if (response.code === 200) {",
									"                const userProfile = response.json();",
									"                if (userProfile.data && userProfile.data.id) {",
									"                    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', userProfile.data.id);",
									"                    console.log('✅ Database User ID:', userProfile.data.id);",
									"                    console.log('✅ User:', userProfile.data.fullName, '(' + userProfile.data.role + ')');",
									"                }",
									"            } else {",
									"                console.error('❌ Failed to fetch user profile. Status:', response.code);",
									"            }",
									"        });",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Login (Supabase)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "apikey",
